{"id":"c2ed46051194e5ee","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-average-polynomial-time.md","title":"df-average-polynomial-time","display":"df-average-polynomial-time","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-average-polynomial-time","aliases":["28-df-average-polynomial-time"],"display":"df-average-polynomial-time","depends_on":["[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]","[[28-df-characteristic-language]]"],"source_book_location":"Definition 18.4 equation (18.1); printed p.364; PDF p.390","source_printed_pages":"364","source_pdf_pages":"390","source_status":"statement-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-average-polynomial-time"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-average-polynomial-time</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-average-polynomial-time"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definition 18.4 equation (18.1); printed p.364; PDF p.390"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"364"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"390"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\">\\(\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f982c99aef3f369e\" href=\"?note=f982c99aef3f369e\" title=\"28-df-characteristic-language\">28-df-characteristic-language</a>，单比特输出串与相应的 0、1 认同。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为确定型机，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A(x)\">\\(A(x)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a> 的时间、输出约定。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\">\\(\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{distP}\">\\(\\operatorname{distP}\\)</span> 分别为 Levin 平均多项式时间谓词和对应问题类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，长度零的输入要求停机正确但不进入分母。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\epsilon,C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\mathbb E_{x\\leftarrow D_n}\\left[\\frac{\\operatorname{time}_A(x)^\\epsilon}{n}\\right]\\le C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\epsilon,C\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\mathbb E_{x\\leftarrow D_n}\\left[\\frac{\\operatorname{time}_A(x)^\\epsilon}{n}\\right]\\le C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{distP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists A\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&lt;\\infty\\land A(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{distP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists A\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)&lt;\\infty\\land A(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应定义 18.4 式 (18.1)，要求某个正次幂矩被 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Cn\">\\(Cn\\)</span> 控制，不能替换成“原始运行时间的期望为多项式”。若新模型时间至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a(t+1)^d\">\\(a(t+1)^d\\)</span>，适当缩小指数可保留该条件。算法须对所有输入正确停机，不能忽略 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_n\">\\(D_n\\)</span> 支撑外输入。长度零的有限例外不改变复杂度类。新增用于补足第 18 章定义；查找范围同 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" href=\"?note=d4b3c83a7ffb542c\" title=\"28-df-distributional-problem\">28-df-distributional-problem</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-distributional-problem]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-characteristic-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$，见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]，单比特输出串与相应的 0、1 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-characteristic-language","status":"resolved","id":"f982c99aef3f369e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}$，见 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]；$\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}$ 见 [[28-df-characteristic-language]]，单比特输出串与相应的 0、1 认同。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为确定型机，$\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}$、$A(x)$ 使用 [[28-df-machine-resources]] 的时间、输出约定。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-distributional-problem","status":"resolved","id":"d4b3c83a7ffb542c","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"对应定义 18.4 式 (18.1)，要求某个正次幂矩被 $Cn$ 控制，不能替换成“原始运行时间的期望为多项式”。若新模型时间至多 $a(t+1)^d$，适当缩小指数可保留该条件。算法须对所有输入正确停机，不能忽略 $D_n$ 支撑外输入。长度零的有限例外不改变复杂度类。新增用于补足第 18 章定义；查找范围同 [[28-df-distributional-problem]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_L:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_A(x)\\in\\mathbb N\\cup\\{+\\infty\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{distP}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\exists\\epsilon,C\\in\\mathbb R_{>0}\\;\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\mathbb E_{x\\leftarrow D_n}\\left[\\frac{\\operatorname{time}_A(x)^\\epsilon}{n}\\right]\\le C.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{distP}\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\langle L,D\\rangle\\in\\operatorname{DistProblem}\\ \\middle|\\ \\exists A\\;\\left[\\forall x\\in\\Sigma^*\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{time}_A(x)<\\infty\\land A(x)=\\chi_L(x)\\bigr)\\land\\operatorname{AvgPoly}(A,D)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Cn","display":false},{"tex":"a(t+1)^d","display":false},{"tex":"D_n","display":false}],"bytes":2033,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-224","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第18章：平均情形复杂性：[[28-df-distributional-problem]]、[[28-df-average-polynomial-time]]。"},{"id":"c60a910dfdfc76dc","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{distNP}$ 见 [[28-df-distnp]]；$\\le_{\\operatorname{avg}}$ 见 [[28-df-distributional-levin-reduction]]；$\\operatorname{distP}$ 见 [[28-df-average-polynomial-time]]。"}],"outgoing":["d4b3c83a7ffb542c","b5d4fc2d291ce98b","f982c99aef3f369e"]}